---
interface Props { lang?: 'fr' | 'en' }
const { lang = 'fr' } = Astro.props;
const fr = lang === 'fr';
const title = fr ? 'Titres retirés et trésorerie versée' : 'Securities retired and cash paid';
const description = fr
  ? 'Exemple fictif en millions de dollars. Le vendeur livre 100 de nominal au Trésor. Le Trésor verse 98 de prix et 1 d’intérêts courus, soit 99. Il retire 100 de principal. Sa trésorerie provient de recettes publiques et/ou de nouvelles émissions.'
  : 'Fictional example in USD millions. Sellers deliver 100 of par to Treasury. Treasury pays 98 in clean price and 1 in accrued interest, totalling 99, and retires 100 of principal. Receipts and/or new borrowing fund its cash account.';
---
<figure class="buyback-mechanism">
  <div class="figure-heading"><span>{fr ? 'EXEMPLE FICTIF · MILLIONS USD' : 'FICTIONAL EXAMPLE · USD MILLIONS'}</span><h3>{title}</h3></div>
  <svg class="wide" viewBox="0 0 720 300" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-labelledby={`bb-${lang}-wide-title bb-${lang}-wide-desc`} style="width:100%;height:auto">
    <title id={`bb-${lang}-wide-title`}>{title}</title><desc id={`bb-${lang}-wide-desc`}>{description}</desc>
    <g fill="var(--color-surface)" stroke="var(--color-line-strong)"><rect x="16" y="66" width="148" height="85" rx="8"/><rect x="556" y="66" width="148" height="85" rx="8"/><rect x="16" y="218" width="420" height="60" rx="8"/><rect x="556" y="218" width="148" height="60" rx="8"/></g>
    <g fill="var(--color-paper)" text-anchor="middle" font-size="20"><text x="90" y="113">{fr ? 'Vendeurs' : 'Sellers'}</text><text x="630" y="113">{fr ? 'Trésor US' : 'US Treasury'}</text></g>
    <g fill="none" stroke="var(--color-signal)" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M176 90H544M536 84l8 6-8 6"/></g>
    <text x="360" y="70" fill="var(--color-signal)" text-anchor="middle" font-size="20">{fr ? 'Titres livrés : 100 M$' : 'Securities delivered: $100m'}</text>
    <g fill="none" stroke="var(--color-amber)" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M544 132H176M184 126l-8 6 8 6"/></g>
    <text x="360" y="166" fill="var(--color-amber)" text-anchor="middle" font-size="20">{fr ? 'Cash : 98 + 1 = 99 M$' : 'Cash: 98 + 1 = $99m'}</text>
    <g fill="none" stroke="var(--color-muted)" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M436 248H518V182H592V154M586 162l6-8 6 8"/><path d="M664 154V215M658 207l6 8 6-8"/></g>
    <text x="226" y="254" fill="var(--color-paper)" text-anchor="middle" font-size="18">{fr ? 'Recettes et/ou nouvelles émissions' : 'Receipts and/or new borrowing'}</text>
    <text x="630" y="243" fill="var(--color-signal)" text-anchor="middle" font-size="19">{fr ? '100 M$' : '$100m'}</text>
    <text x="630" y="267" fill="var(--color-muted)" text-anchor="middle" font-size="17">{fr ? 'nominal retiré' : 'par retired'}</text>
  </svg>
  <svg class="narrow" viewBox="0 0 360 370" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-labelledby={`bb-${lang}-narrow-title bb-${lang}-narrow-desc`} style="width:100%;height:auto">
    <title id={`bb-${lang}-narrow-title`}>{title}</title><desc id={`bb-${lang}-narrow-desc`}>{description}</desc>
    <g fill="var(--color-surface)" stroke="var(--color-line-strong)"><rect x="12" y="76" width="114" height="72" rx="8"/><rect x="234" y="76" width="114" height="72" rx="8"/><rect x="12" y="246" width="192" height="92" rx="8"/><rect x="218" y="246" width="130" height="92" rx="8"/></g>
    <g fill="var(--color-paper)" text-anchor="middle" font-size="19"><text x="69" y="116">{fr ? 'Vendeurs' : 'Sellers'}</text><text x="291" y="116">{fr ? 'Trésor US' : 'Treasury'}</text></g>
    <g fill="none" stroke="var(--color-signal)" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M136 94H224M216 88l8 6-8 6"/></g>
    <text x="180" y="42" fill="var(--color-signal)" text-anchor="middle" font-size="19">{fr ? 'Titres : 100 M$' : 'Securities: $100m'}</text>
    <text x="180" y="65" fill="var(--color-muted)" text-anchor="middle" font-size="17">{fr ? 'livraison du nominal' : 'delivery of principal'}</text>
    <g fill="none" stroke="var(--color-amber)" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M224 130H136M144 124l-8 6 8 6"/></g>
    <text x="180" y="182" fill="var(--color-amber)" text-anchor="middle" font-size="19">{fr ? 'Cash : 99 M$' : 'Cash: $99m'}</text>
    <text x="180" y="205" fill="var(--color-muted)" text-anchor="middle" font-size="17">{fr ? '98 + 1 d’intérêts' : '98 + 1 interest'}</text>
    <g fill="none" stroke="var(--color-muted)" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M188 244V222H252V152M246 160l6-8 6 8"/><path d="M310 152V244M304 236l6 8 6-8"/></g>
    <g text-anchor="middle" font-size="17" fill="var(--color-paper)"><text x="108" y="279">{fr ? 'Recettes publiques' : 'Public receipts'}</text><text x="108" y="305">{fr ? 'et/ou nouvelle dette' : 'and/or new debt'}</text></g>
    <text x="283" y="280" fill="var(--color-signal)" text-anchor="middle" font-size="21">{fr ? '100 M$' : '$100m'}</text>
    <text x="283" y="307" fill="var(--color-muted)" text-anchor="middle" font-size="16">{fr ? 'nominal retiré' : 'par retired'}</text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>{fr ? 'Obligation nominale fictive. Le prix représente 98 pour 100 ; les intérêts courus totalisent 1 M$. Les flèches décrivent des transferts, sans échelle de durée. La source de financement n’est pas attribuée à une émission précise.' : 'Fictional nominal bond. The clean price is 98 per 100; total accrued interest is $1m. Arrows show transfers, with no time scale. Funding is not attributed to a particular new issue.'} <a href="https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-31/subtitle-B/chapter-II/subchapter-A/part-375">{fr ? 'Méthode : 31 CFR 375.2 et 375.23.' : 'Method: 31 CFR 375.2 and 375.23.'}</a></figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
  .buyback-mechanism { margin:1.8rem 0 2.2rem; padding:1rem 0 1rem; border-block:1px solid var(--color-line); font-family:var(--font-read); }
  .figure-heading { padding:0 .5rem .4rem; }
  .figure-heading span { color:var(--color-muted); font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:.65rem; letter-spacing:.07em; }
  .figure-heading h3 { margin:.45rem 0 0; color:var(--color-bright); font-size:1.05rem; line-height:1.4; }
  svg { display:block; max-width:100%; font-family:var(--font-read); }
  .narrow { display:none; }
  figcaption { max-width:72ch; margin:.8rem .5rem 0; color:var(--color-muted); font-size:.8rem; line-height:1.6; }
  a { color:var(--color-signal); text-decoration:underline; text-underline-offset:3px; }
  @media(max-width:600px) { .wide { display:none; } .narrow { display:block; } }
</style>
